      "id": "2119226703616655709",
      "text": "Nuggets beat the Pacers 114-102 in Mexico City. Jokic led all with 19-13-8. First half was costly. Pacers trimmed the 27-point deficit to 7 with 7:26 to go, but Nuggets held on. Siakam scored 23, Nance Jr. with 15pts off the bench. Next: Mon. at DAL",
