      "id": "2119213082404888780",
      "text": "Jalen Slawson in, replacing Braden Smith. So now all 13 players have played. Giving the altitude, I figured everyone would get minutes. Quinn Buckner shares that guard T.J. McConnell, is his first game due to a hamstring strain, will not play in the second half.",
